==== Serial Port ====
 
The UART is accessable via JP1 (which already has a header connected!). You will need a TTL to RS232 (ie a MAX232 circuit) to utilise this. See picture further down. The pinout is:\\
''[TxD] [GND] [3.3v]      [RxD]''\\
''                         JP1''

